<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOL" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joel</para>
  <para style="mt1">Joel</para>
  <para style="imt1">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Joel chekhai, now arui khin dow 500-400 BC takra kowi chekhai. Aia dow Juda pren kowi Joas chowm mang mih khin hownia Ahas chowm mang mih khin mowr khe kowh krawi tek lai mih risi naown kown. Sangbowk Laitawm Prim khin khe kowh chabowih rui mih risiuüa pungmadawng kowi Joel dow lang prim mih risi naown kown mih sakowmra uowi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Risi Joel kowh chownglawng lawnguan kowi dow achima tukah dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw risi Joel chownglawng kowi matawng khe kowh chünchü plawng hawmh piak pren mih aia krumla khai. Nami plawng hawmh piak pren mih lawnguan mami bowih kowi aia ruila khai. Naiawngün lawnguan hownia CHAKRAMANG nauang kown mih khin khe kowh aia nau iawng uowi dowi miuüa kowi naripah kown mih amatra risi Joel khi khai. Naiawng rakowi aia maru-uüa mih angak hownia tarip hanow CHAKRAMANG prakowi nauang plan kownkow risi Joel krawi tek khai. Angak hownia tarip hai CHAKRAMANG prakowi che uang plan büah hanow CHAKRAMANG nasanaah kown mih laikham paw aia tekla khai, now masiuüa kachakuüa, malauüa klanguüa hai lawngtang matanguüa bowkbowk luk kowi CHAKRAMANG nauang klai pe aia kowh lümlasai kown mih laikham lawnguan paw Joel tekla khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih lawnguan dow “CHAKRAMANG kowh ni” pami chekhai. CHAKRAMANG kowh ni pami dow chenchapuüa kowi aia nachet pe tara hai naripah kownkow aia khowm bowkta mih ni chekhai, now pabak mih maru-uüa kowi dow aia nalawngah kown mih ni chekhai. Nami ni dow aiiuma hai iu krang anumma mih ni chekhai, nami ni dow uangnim iawng iu krang akringma mih ni chekhai. Nami lawnguan kowi dow Joel 1:15, 2:1,2,11,31, 3:8 uan kowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Lümlasai: Lümlasai pami dow a-i tut-e kowh uowi mih lümla nadowi; nami dow Thurai tut-e kowh uowi mih lümla chekhai. Nami lümlasai kowi nauang kruitown a-i kownkow Sangbowk Laitawm Sar khin khe dow a-i tut-e Thurai uang chinah khai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Baw: Baw pami dow alai chowng khe takua talawm khe kowh changla atün mih chekhai. Nami dow nang hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai. Alai chowng khe kowh maru-uüa dow chia nang hai akeng mih nang ün phawah now atün hown natakua talawm kown mih hai nacham dowk tasen kown mih matra ün changla khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat chowng dow baw mih lawngha hown hai akeng mih uanh hown paw thawpah khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Plawng hawmh uang krawi sen mih lawnguan 1:1-20</para>
  <para style="io1">Ransu-uüa uang krawi sen mih lawnguan 2:1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Juda kowi natarip kown mih laiklow tek pe mih 2:12-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Pur prakowi nalawngah kown mih hai napeah prasi kown mih laikham 2:18-3:21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOL 1:1" />Pethuel kowh chapa Joel tut-e mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai.<verse eid="JOL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Plawng hawmh rakowi Judauüa kawm mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOL 1:2" />Joel tek mih, “Enni aluchowuüa low, sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:2">Juda prenchakuüa low, enni bowkbowk sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:2">Enni chownglawng kowi maiawng mih enni uan kakat khowk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:2">Enni pipu-uüa chownglawng kowi paw maiawng mih uanla kakat tak bow?<verse eid="JOL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOL 1:3" />Mami lawnguan dow atungma lawpah büah reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:3">enni dow enni kowh chauüa kowi lawp pe diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:3">Enni kowh chauüa paw amatni kowh chauüa kowi pacham lawp pe lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:3">amatni kowh chauüa paw amatni kowh chauüa kowi pacham lawp pe lah.<verse eid="JOL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOL 1:4" />Plawng hawmh dow aplan aplan uang piak pren khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:4">ahawmsang mih plawng kremta mih kung kowi dow krawi piak mih plawng uang ta cha khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:4">Ahawm sang mih plawng ta lawtta mih dow chet mih plawng uang chata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:4">chet mih plawng ta lawtta mih dow apiak mih plawng hawmh uang chata khai.<verse eid="JOL 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOL 1:5" />Pua miuüa low, rü büa diah, now kar büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:5">Arak kham miuüa low, grep tui sar hown kowh arak vüi kar büah nguk büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow enni ka kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOL 1:6" />Plawng siphai hawmh dow nauang sen ang pren kownkow uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:6">amatni dow akürma hai akawm krang paw ia rüaah dowi mowr chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:6">Amatni kowh iüng dow krangsila kowh iüng iawng achukma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:6">amatni kowh sah paw krangsima kowh sah iawng achukma chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOL 1:7" />Amatni dow ang kowh grep ruih maten kremta ang büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:7">ang kowh uidut singh maten paw phukta ang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:7">Uidut singh pik maten klawngta ang büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:7">naiawng rakowi amia ün dow akawdawkma kangowh ta uowi khai.<verse eid="JOL 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOL 1:8" />“Ang maru-uüa low, kar hown nguk hown uowi büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:8">ahua kham kowng khe khup sala uanh hanow malauüa dow kar reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:8">Nami iawng dow enni paw khup sala uanh hanow kar büa diah.<verse eid="JOL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOL 1:9" />CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh uanap pawi rim khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:9">kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap pawi chang büah dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:9">Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh lup chang mih uamowuüa kar hai nguk khai bowt.<verse eid="JOL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOL 1:10" />Uih-ien pantawn dow tapiak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:10">now grep tui sar paw kang khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:10">Kanrawn sau dow khowk kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:10">üa maten dow tapiak bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:10">Naiawng rakowi krawng dow kar hai nguk hown uowi khai bowt.<verse eid="JOL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOL 1:11" />“Aw üa lup chang miuüa, sak nga kowh kar büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:11">grep krum khet miuüa low, tuak krat churma hown uowi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:11">now püm hai iakmow rakowi kar hai nguk hown uowi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow üa kowi kowh uih-ien pantawn maten piak bowk khowk.<verse eid="JOL 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOL 1:12" />Grep ruih dow keu khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:12">now uidut singh paw kowng khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:12">Chekmarawng, dalim hai apel uih paw piak bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:12">now krum kowi kowh singh maten paw piak bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:12">Maru-uüa tut-e kowh awmrawmra mih chur khai bowt nowm.<verse eid="JOL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tarip hai uang plan kown mih hawk klow</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOL 1:13" />“Aw uamowuüa low, khup sala uan büah hanow taprüa taiia mih tüng büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:13">phuchuara kowi kowh chintak miuüa low, kar hai nguk hown uowi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:13">ang kowh Thurai chintak miuüa low, uang khupla sala uan hanow krü uar büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh Thurai chup kim kowi kowh pawi dow taingta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:13">kan hap phuchuara hai khamah mih phuchuara pawi dow taingta khai bowt.<verse eid="JOL 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOL 1:14" />Chimsaima mih hawm khang khin phuangah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:14">nauang takua talawm kownkow maru-uüa kowi hawah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:14">Aluchowuüa hai prenchakuüa maten kowi hawah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:14">amatni kowi dow enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai kim kowi pe uangah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:14">now CHAKRAMANG tut-e pe nguk pe karah diah.<verse eid="JOL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOL 1:15" />Uh! Kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow <char style="w">CHAKRAMANG kowh ni</char> dow uang tawn khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:15">Nami piakra ni dow CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh uang ting mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOL 1:16" />“A-i kowh chakkham uowi dowi bowt mih i khi khowk nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:16">CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh piawra tama khowk mih i khi khowk nadowi bow?<verse eid="JOL 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOL 1:17" />Sawtah mih liu dow krawng kangma kowi su khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:17">naiawng rakowi tawng iawng mih luprak paw phaw dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:17">Uih-ak liu krümra kim dow tapiak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:17">now uih-ak towk rah kim paw piakta khai bowt.<verse eid="JOL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOL 1:18" />Tawncher hawmh dow lainowmma kar khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:18">ka taw rah dowi rakowi amatni dow ngare khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:18">Chia hawmh dow cham mang panglang se pu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:18">now ruapur hawmh paw lainowmma kawm khai.<verse eid="JOL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG tut-e Joel lü prasi mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOL 1:19" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, khowng ang kownkow ang haw en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 1:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow taw rah süng ün dow maih kamta bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:19">now kaurawng kowi kowh singh kau maten paw maih kamta bowk khowk.<verse eid="JOL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOL 1:20" />Naiawng rakowi kaurawng uaramchak khowm padow en tut-e uang kar khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:20">tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh tui khamra awchawng dow kang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 1:20">kaurawng kowi kowh chak rah kham rah dow maih kamta bowk khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOL 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOL 2" />
  <para style="s">Plawng siphai hawmh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOL 2:1" />Zaiawn hungh kowi tum baw büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:1">ang kowh hungh chimsaima mih kowi phih uang ting mih hai nadowk tasen kown mih klow tüng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:1">Pren kowi kowh uowi mih srui kram hown pacham chür lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh ni dow uang ting kown chowbowt;<verse eid="JOL 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOL 2:2" />CHAKRAMANG kowh ni dow aiiuma hai iu krang anumma mih ni chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:2">nami ni dow uangnim iawng iu krang akringma mih ni chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:2">Hungma mawngma kowi rau-e khe sat nowi uang sawt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:2">nami iawng plawng siphai hawmh akürma hai akraingma mih dow uang tarü khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:2">Naiawng mih siphai hawmh dow alai chowng khe katpaw uowi dowi tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:2">naiawng mih dow nauang tale mih chowng maten kowi paw katpaw nauowi kown nadowi tham.<verse eid="JOL 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOL 2:3" />Amatni uang tarü mih khin khe amatni pur kowi dow maih krawi kam khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:3">now amatni kung kowi dow maih lün bia laplap mih krawi ta mang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:3">Amatni uang towm dowi rawn dow pren mih Eden krum iawng chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:3">amatni klenla kung kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:3">now tawng chap paw ta lat mih uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOL 2:4" />Amatni kowh powm dow kawrnga iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:4">amatni dow tasen müa kawrnga iawng iowm lenma chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOL 2:5" />Amatni kowh mang klow dow tasen müa kawrnga iowm tün iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:5">amatni dow hungh luk hownia uang chet büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:5">Amatni dow dowm kowi kowh kamla pram bowk mih maih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:5">amatni dow akürma mih siphai hawmh cham tarü tasen mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOL 2:6" />Amatni kowi khi hanow prenchakuüa kowh saktuak dow lainowmma pusa khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:6">takrow lai rakowi amatni kowh lumowr dow müakangma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOL 2:7" />Nami siphaiuüa dow tasen akiakma miuüa iawng iowm lenma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:7">now siphaiuüa iawng dow tap kowi paw nowng pün büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:7">Amatni dow atanma mang lawmlawm chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:7">amatni dow amatni kowh mangra tiama hownia süt büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOL 2:8" />Amatni dow lowkkowlowk taet büah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:8">amatni dow pur prakowi atengma mang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:8">Lowra mih akrat pusara uang ting chepaw thüa büah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:8">amatni dow tan piak dowi kowi atengma mang büah khai.<verse eid="JOL 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOL 2:9" />Amatni dow marow lak kowi uang krawi chet khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:9">now tap luk kowi ün uang krawi iowm büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:9">Amatni dow kim kowi ün krawi pün khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:9">kuk mih iawng dow tawngpawk hownia krawi kup büah khai.<verse eid="JOL 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOL 2:10" />Amatni pur kowi dow mukuang hai lusa khowm padow chür khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:10">now sat, lama hai krek ün khowm padow nowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOL 2:11" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh siphaiuüa pur kowi rik mang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:11">now aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi dow atünma peah ana reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:11">Aia kowh siphaiuüa dow maru iun nowng rüaah dowi mowr chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:11">aia kowh ana pek chün miuüa maten dow akürma kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh ni dow akraingma hai kramra uowima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:11">amia iawng mih paw nami ni dow nowng kham dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang plan kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOL 2:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:12">“Nachenganchepaw kawmat paw akhin uowi tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:12">enni kowh saktuak maten hown ang tut-e uang plan büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:12">Khang hawm büa diah, kar hai nguk hown uowi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:12">now enni kowh sak kowi rau mih tüngah büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOL 2:13" />Naiawng rakowi enni kowh tawnguat nadowi kowi enni kowh saktuak phai sekah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:13">enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tut-e uang plan büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh dow saksing sanara atekma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:13">aia dow kunmarau naklak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:13">now aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow akraingma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:13">Aia dow maru kowi rip kown nau dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:13">aia dow nape lawt kownkow atungma kamrüt hown uowi reng.<verse eid="JOL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOL 2:14" />Aia dow leta saktuak iawk chepaw naia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:14">now aia dow nape enni prasi iawk chepaw naia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:14">CHAKRAMANG tut-e alai kowh iawng enni naia chang uanap iawk chepaw naia kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:14">enni kowh Thurai tut-e kawmdi uanap hai hüngah mih uanap enni naia chang iawk chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="JOL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOL 2:15" />Zaiawn hungh kowi tum baw büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:15">chimsaima mih hawm khang khin phuangah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:15">now nauang takua talawm kownkow maru-uüa kowi hawah büa diah.<verse eid="JOL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOL 2:16" />Chimsaima mih takua khin vüi maru kawmuüa kowi pe kamrütah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:16">lawngtang hownia kham iawn reng tak mih ngeuüa hawmh mowr kuaah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:16">Chang dawngthawng sar mih masi huaiu khowm padow amatchi kowh kim lak hownia nauang lawt kown takla.<verse eid="JOL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOL 2:17" />CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh chintak mih uamowuüa dow pacham kar lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:17">amatni dow Thurai chup kim kimpuk hai phuchuara takra kowi pacham kar lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:17">Amatni dow, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, en maru-uüa luk kowi sanaah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:17">en kowh dawngthawnguan kowi hangkow changah maru prawng renra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:17">now akeng prenchakuüa tut-e amatni kowi mih hangkow pe chowngah rensi küakau diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:17">‘Tawng kowi chow kowbüah kowh Thurai?’ padow akeng chenchapuüa hang pacham tek lah,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:17">pahai pacham chup Thurai büah lah.<verse eid="JOL 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG peah prasi iawk kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOL 2:18" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh pren kowi nanganah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:18">now aia maru-uüa kowi dow nasaksing sanaah kown.<verse eid="JOL 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOL 2:19" />Aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi maiawng naklangah kown:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:19">“Uih-ak, sau hai grep tui sar ang uang chin enni khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:19">nami hown dow klangiungma enni naduh bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:19">Akeng prenchakuüa tut-e ang nachangla enni prawng renra kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOL 2:20" />“Tawngphak hownia kowh uang mih siphaiuüa kowi alakma kowi ang naprütta enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:20">amatni kowi dow akang khawngma hai apiaknama mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang nachinah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:20">Amatni kowi dow dawnglang mowr mih satlawt pra kowh sata kowi ang naprütah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:20">now dawnglang mowr dow satkup pra kowh sata kowi ang naprütah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:20">Amatni kowh su nam dow kuang prakowi napün kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOL 2:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:20">CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma mih lup chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOL 2:21" />Aw pren, hangkow kram diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:21">piaw diah, now awmrawm diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma chang lup khai.<verse eid="JOL 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOL 2:22" />Aw dowm kowi kowh asadua hawmh, hangkow kram büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:22">enni kowh tawkra dowm dow pram asingma uang awmh khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:22">Singh ün dow nauih iawk kown chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:22">uidut singh hai grep ruih paw achakma uown uih khowk.<verse eid="JOL 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOL 2:23" />Aw Zaiawn maru-uüa low, awmrawm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:23">enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai chang enni mih rakowi piaw büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni lakke mowr aia dow pe enni uang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:23">alai kowh iawng uang müng hai manawng uang paw aia dow pe enni khai.<verse eid="JOL 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOL 2:24" />Bawk ün dow uih-ak hown natek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:24">now grep tui hai sau ün dow kawng hownia nave kown.<verse eid="JOL 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOL 2:25" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:25">“Enni tut-e kowh uang mih plawng siphai hawmh dow krem mih plawng hai ahawmsang mih plawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:25">chet mih plawng hai krawi piak mih plawng hawmh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:25">Nauang kingküa enni kownkow naiawngün plawng hawmh kowi uang chinah mih dow ang chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:25">naiawngün plawng hawmh piakta enni mih maten ang naplan pe enni iawk kown.<verse eid="JOL 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOL 2:26" />Mu tek dowi mowr duh pat enni naka cha kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:26">enni vüi awdara hai lakkhiara lup ahuma chang reng mih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:26">CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi enni narowsiah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:26">Ang maru-uüa dow tawng nam khe paw narukrai kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOL 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOL 2:27" />Nami khin khe dow ang kowh maru Israeluüa tut-e ang uowi reng pami enni natuk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:27">enni kowh Thurai hai enni kowh CHAKRAMANG ang chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:27">now ang klen kowi dow mia iawng mih thurai paw uowi dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:27">Ang maru-uüa dow katpaw narukrai kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOL 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lümlasai lawnguan kowi Thurai kowh laikham</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOL 2:28" />“Nami kung kowi dow maru maten luk kowi ang lümla ang nauang hüng pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:28">Enni kowh chapa chamauüa dow risi iawng natek Thurai lai kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:28">enni kowh lawngtang matanguüa dow ang hownia kowh mang nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:28">now enni kowh malauüa hown klanguüa hawmh dow nakhi mukmang kown.<verse eid="JOL 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOL 2:29" />Nami khin khe dow naruüa luk kowi khowm padow ang naklai pe lümla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:29">now kachakuüa hai masiuüa nar luk kowi paw ang matia lümla ang naklai pe kown.<verse eid="JOL 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOL 2:30" />Mukuang hai lusa kowi amatra ang natüngah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:30">vi, maih hai maikhük ahuma ang natüngah kown.<verse eid="JOL 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOL 2:31" />Sat dow naiu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:31">lama paw vi iawng aringma naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:31">Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ni nauang ting kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:31">nami ni dow akraingma hai kramra uowima mih ni naown kown.<verse eid="JOL 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOL 2:32" />Ka lawngra kownkow CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau mih maten dow naka lawngra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:32">now Zaiawn hungh hai Jerusalem kowi kowh maru dow naplai sangrum kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 2:32">Nami dow CHAKRAMANG tekta iawng nauang phaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 2:32">now naplai kown miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG lang kloah miuüa naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOL 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOL 3" />
  <para style="s">Akeng prenchakuüa kowi chet pe tara mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOL 3:1" />Naiawng rakowi nami ni hai nami khin khe dow Juda hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi alai kowh iawng ang natowah iawk kown. <verse eid="JOL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOL 3:2" />Nakhowk khe dow akeng prenchakuüa maten kowi ang nakuaah kown, now tara chetra lawngrawi kowi ang nauang klala kown. Amatni dow ang kowh dawngthawnguan, ang maru Israeluüa kowi akeng pren kowi cham uetah khai, now ang kowh pren dow amatni taretah khai. Naiawng rakowi nami lawngrawi kowi dow amatni kowi ang nachet pe tara kown. <verse eid="JOL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOL 3:3" />Amatni dow ang maru-uüa kowi nakala kownkow taretah khe kuak plang büah khai. Amatni dow nakala chawkkrawma kownkow Israel kachakuüa ngeuuüa kowi sumah büah khai, now naka khamla grep tui kownkow Israel masiuüa ngeuuüa kowi paw sumah büah khai.<verse eid="JOL 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOL 3:4" />Aw Sur, Sidawn hai Filistin marow riaret kowi kowh uowi mih maten, tawng chow nachang ang kownkow enni kamrüt? Enni sat ang klai kownkow enni kamrüt mih bow? Enni che sat ang klai khai hanow enni sat ang klai hown akrowksang enni luk kowi nauang kla kown. Nami dow enni chang ang iawng rowprowp enni luk kowi paw alenma ang nachang enni kown. <verse eid="JOL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOL 3:5" />Ang kowh kuh hai tai enni pawta ang khai, now ang kowh asung lang khak mih uanh paw enni pawla hanow enni kowh thurai chup kim kowi enni kowtowah khai. <verse eid="JOL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOL 3:6" />Juda hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi dow enni henta kownkow amatni pren hownia alakma mih Grisuüa pren kowi enni cham sumah khai.<verse eid="JOL 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOL 3:7" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow enni cham sumah mih arah hownia amatni kowi ang nauang pawla bowt kown; amatni kowi enni changah iawng enni luk kowi paw ang nachang enni bowt kown. <verse eid="JOL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOL 3:8" />Enni kowh chauüa kowi dow Juda maru-uüa tut-e maru nacham sumah kown, now amatni kowi dow alakma mih Sabean chenchapuüa tut-e Juda maru-uüa nacham sumah kown. Mami laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG tekah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JOL 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOL 3:9" />Akeng prenchakuüa tut-e maiawng kowkrawi tek büa diah:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:9">“Dowk tasen kownkow kamrüt büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:9">akürma mih maru-uüa kowi uang hawla büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:9">now nadowk tasen kownkow tarü büa diah.<verse eid="JOL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOL 3:10" />Enni kowh laithawn tim dow thawpla saidawng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:10">now enni kowh tangchen dow thawpla reh büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:10">Kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi khowm sangah tasen büa diah.<verse eid="JOL 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOL 3:11" />Aw akeng prenchak maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:11">lawngrawi kowi alenma uang takua büa diah,” pape diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:11">Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh maru akürma mih kowi uang chin diah.<verse eid="JOL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOL 3:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:12">“Akeng prenchakuüa maten pacham uang lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:12">amatni dow Tara Chetra Lawngrawi kowi pakowkowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:12">Nakowi dow chenchapuüa maten kowi ang nachet pe tara kown.<verse eid="JOL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOL 3:13" />Amatni kowh dow angak lainowmma hu khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:13">naiawng rakowi cha min khe kowh ngen cha iawng bowkbowk kowi ngenta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:13">now grep uih thuara kowi atui towk pat thua grep uih iawng amatni kowi thuaah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:13">Grep uih küara dow ue prang towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:13">tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh dow angak lainowmma hu khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOL 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOL 3:14" />Tara Chetra Lawngrawi kowi maru kawm lai bowt kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:14">Nakowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh tara chetra ni nauang towm kown chowbowt.<verse eid="JOL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOL 3:15" />Sat hai lama dow naiu kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:15">krek ün paw nanowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa kowi Thurai napeah prasi kown</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOL 3:16" />CHAKRAMANG dow Zaiawn hungh hownia nahek kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:16">aia dow Jerusalem hownia atünma natek lai kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:16">Naiawng rakowi krawng hai mukuang mih nachür kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:16">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru-uüa vüi tatung tanimra naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:16">aia dow Israeluüa vüi akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim nachowng kown.<verse eid="JOL 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOL 3:17" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:17">“Nami khin khe dow ang chowtaih enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai pami enni natuk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:17">now ang kowh hungh chimsaima mih Zaiawn kowi ang uowi reng pami enni natuk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:17">Jerusalem marow dow nachim nasai bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:17">asür alawkma mih prenchakuüa katpaw nauang nowng kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JOL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOL 3:18" />“Nami ni khe dow hungh aiuk aiukma mih hownia grep tui sar ahuma naka kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:18">now hungh asowm asowmchow mih hownia dow iawn tui ahuma naka kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:18">Juda pren kowi kowh awchawng awlang maten hownia dow tui nahawr iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:18">CHAKRAMANG chup kim hownia dow tui nauang lawt parah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:18">now Sittim lawngrawi kowi nape kaah tui kown.<verse eid="JOL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOL 3:19" />Nachenganchepaw Aigupta pren dow nachowng mawngchawng kuakra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:19">now Edawm pren dow tapiak khowk mih süngrüp süngkangma iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow Judauüa kowi changah anowng apowng khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:19">Juda pren kowi amatni dow aprek uowi dowi mih maru-uüa kowi krawi sai büah khai.<verse eid="JOL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="JOL 3:20-21" />Nachenganchepaw Juda pren kowi dow maru nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:20-21">Jerusalem kowi paw chowngchowng saksakma maru nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOL 3:20-21">Ang krawi paw pe lu klai dowi tak miuüa vüi ang nakrawi paw pe lu klai kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOL 3:20-21">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG mih Zaiawn hungh kowi ang maru-uüa hown nauowi reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JOL 3:20-21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOL 3" />
</usx>